°.cap.j Drop cap + justify (no symbol consumed because next char is a dot).

!!! Symbol consumed (no space)

°hello world

''Result note:'' `hello` is consumed as a symbol-name. Content is `world` only. To keep `hello world` intact, write `° hello world` with a leading space.